[CENTER][IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/UltraWarps/assets/banner.png[/IMG]

[SIZE=5][B]Server & player warps with categories.[/B][/SIZE]

UltraWarps puts server warps into a GUI with categories and icons. Optionally players can create their own warps, for example for their shop.
UltraWarps is part of the [B][COLOR=#8B5CF6]Ultra[/COLOR][COLOR=#22D3EE]Plugins[/COLOR][/B] series: every plugin shares the same colours, the same message layout and the same command structure.

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-features.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*]Warp GUI with categories, icons and search
[*]Optional player warps with costs and visit counter
[*]Optional permission per warp
[*]Sort by name, popularity or date
[*]Warm-up, cooldown and teleport costs
[*]Import from EssentialsX
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-layout.png[/IMG]

No chat spam. Every confirmation, countdown and status appears in the [B]action bar[/B].
Only [B][COLOR=#F87171]errors[/COLOR][/B] are sent to the chat, so players never miss them.
All messages use MiniMessage and can be changed in [FONT=Courier New]messages.yml[/FONT].

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/UltraWarps/assets/preview.png[/IMG]

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-commands.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/warp [name][/COLOR][/FONT] – Teleport to a warp [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrawarps.warp)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/warps[/COLOR][/FONT] – Open the warp GUI [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrawarps.warp)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/setwarp <name>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Create a server warp [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrawarps.set)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/delwarp <name>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Delete a warp [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrawarps.delete)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/pwarp <create|delete|list>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Player warps [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrawarps.player)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/ultrawarps <help|reload|version|import>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Administration [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrawarps.admin)[/COLOR]
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-permissions.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultrawarps.warp.<name>[/FONT] – Access to a specific warp
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultrawarps.player.limit.<n>[/FONT] – Maximum number of player warps
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultrawarps.*[/FONT] – Everything
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-installation.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST=1]
[*]Download UltraWarps and drop the jar into your [FONT=Courier New]plugins[/FONT] folder.
[*]Restart your server.
[*]Adjust [FONT=Courier New]config.yml[/FONT] and [FONT=Courier New]messages.yml[/FONT], then run [FONT=Courier New]/ultrawarps reload[/FONT].
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-series.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][B]UltraSpawn[/B] – Spawn management done right.
[*][B]UltraTeleports[/B] – Requests, random teleport & back in one plugin.
[*][B]UltraPunish[/B] – Clean moderation with GUI, templates & history.
[*][B]UltraHomes[/B] – Set, manage and share homes in one GUI.
[*][B]UltraChat[/B] – Formatting, channels & moderation for your chat.
[*][B]UltraEconomy[/B] – Fast, Vault-ready economy with multiple currencies.
[*][B]UltraKits[/B] – Kits with previews, cooldowns & in-game editor.
[*][B]UltraVanish[/B] – True invisibility for your staff team.
[*][B]UltraReports[/B] – Player reports with a staff GUI workflow.
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-support.png[/IMG]

Found a bug or have an idea? Please use the discussion tab or send a private message instead of leaving a bad review. We answer every request.[/CENTER]
